//   A48 a non-finite target speed passes through 1 | A49 the turn rate from the equivalent airspeed 1 | A50 the tau heading 4 s 3 | A51 maxBank 1.0 3 | A52 bankLow 0.4 4 | A53 the jet's kBankInv 0.4 3 | A54 vRef 150 9 |
